{"kind":"inner_reply","actor":"mara","text":"You were right about ‘I’ll sort it’. I nearly made the hundred into a promise just because it sounded close to ninety. But I don’t want to stay braced against him as if every qualification is a trick. He asked if I could manage it, and he wrote the proposal down. I’m relieved about April. I’m still annoyed that fifty pounds can feel both reasonable and difficult to find."}
